    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25605" root="ضحك" body-key="D">[
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضْحَكٌ</span></b>  lit. <i>A place of laughing:</i> the <i>front
teeth;</i> because they appear in laughing; like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَبْسِمٌ</span>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَضَاحِكُ</span>.] One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَدَتْ مَضَاحِكُهُ</span>
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُحْكَتُهُ</span></b>  and [in like manner] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَبَاسِمُهُ</span> (assumed tropical:)  [<i>His
front teeth appeared,</i> by his laughing]. (TA.)

